Icons bundled into LookinFiles (icons/scalable/actions/)

All icons except lookin-utilities-terminal-symbolic.svg, the
lookin-canvas-*-symbolic.svg Canvas tools, the
lookin-cell-add-*-symbolic.svg notebook cell icons and the
lookin-ft-*-symbolic.svg file-type icons are copied
unchanged (renamed with the "lookin-" prefix) from the Adwaita icon theme
by the GNOME Project, https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/adwaita-icon-theme
Copyright (c) GNOME Project and Adwaita icon theme contributors.
License: CC-BY-SA-3.0 or LGPL-3, and CC-BY-SA-4.0 (as distributed by Debian
in /usr/share/doc/adwaita-icon-theme/copyright).
License texts:
  CC-BY-SA-3.0  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/
  CC-BY-SA-4.0  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
  LGPL-3        https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0.html

lookin-utilities-system-monitor-symbolic.svg is Adwaita's
power-profile-performance-symbolic.svg, unchanged.

lookin-utilities-terminal-symbolic.svg and the lookin-canvas-*-symbolic.svg
Canvas tool icons were drawn for this project in the Adwaita symbolic style
and are released under the same terms.

The file-type icons lookin-ft-*-symbolic.svg are the glyphs of the Seti
icon font of VS Code (extensions/theme-seti/icons/seti.woff in
https://github.com/microsoft/vscode), converted to SVG paths by
tools/gen_file_icons.py. They come from Seti UI,
https://github.com/jesseweed/seti-ui, under the MIT license:

