The notebook cell icons lookin-cell-add-above-symbolic.svg and
lookin-cell-add-below-symbolic.svg are the "add-above" and "add-below"
toolbar icons of JupyterLab (packages/ui-components/style/icons/toolbar/ in
https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab), redrawn as single-colour fills
(the stroked plus as a filled shape, no clip path). JupyterLab is under the
BSD 3-Clause license:

