Rules: icons must be single-colour symbolic SVGs without any "transform"
attribute: icon themes whose symbolic icons use transforms (Adwaita "legacy"
icons, elementary-xfce) were reported invisible with GTK 4.22, while the
current Adwaita icons, which never use transforms, are what GTK is tested
with. `make check` enforces it.


The icons of icons/sets/ (icon sets, see docs/configuration.md) were drawn for
this project by tools/gen_desktop_icons.py and are covered by the project
licence.
